{
  "_comment": [
    "BATTLE 02 - The Breach. The prologue's second battle and the demonstration",
    "that objectives change mid-fight (brief section 41).",
    "",
    "Three things make this battle the one worth getting right:",
    "",
    "1. NON-LETHAL. Human enemies reduced to 0 HP are incapacitated, not killed.",
    "   The script is explicit, and the reason is character: Rowan must not become",
    "   a murderer in his first hour.",
    "2. THE ENEMY IS NOT THE VILLAIN. Greenvale soldiers hesitate and call Rowan",
    "   by name. Their AI is deliberately passive for the first two turns.",
    "3. SIDES SWITCH. On turn 3 the Wall collapses, the Wallstalker emerges, and",
    "   every human enemy becomes an ally against it.",
    "",
    "Grid convention as in battle_north_meadow.json: north first, y counts south",
    "to north. The Crownwall runs along the entire north edge."
  ],
  "id": "battle_the_breach",
  "name": "The Breach",
  "scene": "old_watchtower",
  "music": "battle_tense",
  "size": { "width": 14, "height": 12 },
  "terrain": [
    "WWWWWWWWWWWWWW",
    "WWWWWWWWWWWWWW",
    "gguuggggggoogg",
    "ggggggggggoggg",
    "gggggggggggggg",
    "gggggggggggggg",
    "gggggggggggggg",
    "gggggggggggggg",
    "gggggggggggggg",
    "gggggggggggggg",
    "gggggpppgggggg",
    "gggggpppgggggg"
  ],
  "props": [
